# Media (README.md): a classic desktop MP3 player over a file explorer, for
# music on the SD card, a USB drive or a mounted server share, in three
# skins and any classic Winamp skin (.wsz) in ~/Skins. Music plays through
# the shell's player (mpv, part of ZeroOS for Dock). Jellyfin moved to its own app; voice notes to the Recorder app.
NAME="Media"
SUMMARY="Classic MP3 player with a file explorer, pixel-art skins and Winamp skins: music from the SD card, USB drives and servers"
APP_VERSION="3.5.0"
DEPENDS="mpv"
NEEDS="mpv"
